From: Custom Patches <patches@local>
Date: Tue, 11 Nov 2025 11:55:17 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Add backend support for configurable update URL (0.4.9)

- Modify fetchUpdateMetadata to use config.UpdateMetadataURL
